  {
   "id": "matematicas-2011-junio-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:(-1,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\ln(x+1)\\), donde \\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano.",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), el eje \\(OY\\) y la recta \\(y=1\\). Calcula los puntos de corte de las gráficas.",
     "(1,75 p.) Halla el área del recinto anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es la gráfica de \\(\\ln x\\) desplazada una unidad a la izquierda (asíntota vertical \\(x=-1\\)). Cortes:</p><p>• \\(f\\) con \\(OY\\): \\(f(0)=\\ln1=0\\Rightarrow(0,0)\\).</p><p>• \\(f\\) con \\(y=1\\): \\(\\ln(x+1)=1\\iff x=e-1\\Rightarrow(e-1,1)\\).</p><p>• \\(y=1\\) con \\(OY\\): \\((0,1)\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='98.0,50.0 99.9,50.0 101.7,50.0 103.6,50.0 105.4,50.0 107.3,50.0 109.2,50.0 111.0,50.0 112.9,50.0 114.8,50.0 116.6,50.0 118.5,50.0 120.3,50.0 122.2,50.0 124.1,50.0 125.9,50.0 127.8,50.0 129.6,50.0 131.5,50.0 133.4,50.0 135.2,50.0 137.1,50.0 139.0,50.0 140.8,50.0 142.7,50.0 144.5,50.0 146.4,50.0 148.3,50.0 150.1,50.0 152.0,50.0 153.8,50.0 155.7,50.0 157.6,50.0 159.4,50.0 161.3,50.0 163.2,50.0 165.0,50.0 166.9,50.0 168.7,50.0 170.6,50.0 172.5,50.0 174.3,50.0 176.2,50.0 178.0,50.0 179.9,50.0 181.8,50.0 183.6,50.0 185.5,50.0 187.4,50.0 189.2,50.0 191.1,50.0 192.9,50.0 194.8,50.0 196.7,50.0 198.5,50.0 200.4,50.0 202.2,50.0 204.1,50.0 206.0,50.0 207.8,50.0 209.7,50.0 209.7,50.0 207.8,50.5 206.0,51.1 204.1,51.6 202.2,52.2 200.4,52.7 198.5,53.3 196.7,53.8 194.8,54.4 192.9,55.0 191.1,55.6 189.2,56.2 187.4,56.8 185.5,57.4 183.6,58.0 181.8,58.6 179.9,59.2 178.0,59.9 176.2,60.5 174.3,61.2 172.5,61.8 170.6,62.5 168.7,63.2 166.9,63.9 165.0,64.6 163.2,65.3 161.3,66.0 159.4,66.7 157.6,67.5 155.7,68.2 153.8,69.0 152.0,69.8 150.1,70.6 148.3,71.4 146.4,72.2 144.5,73.0 142.7,73.8 140.8,74.7 139.0,75.6 137.1,76.5 135.2,77.4 133.4,78.3 131.5,79.2 129.6,80.2 127.8,81.1 125.9,82.1 124.1,83.1 122.2,84.2 120.3,85.2 118.5,86.3 116.6,87.4 114.8,88.5 112.9,89.7 111.0,90.9 109.2,92.1 107.3,93.3 105.4,94.6 103.6,95.9 101.7,97.2 99.9,98.6 98.0,100.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='49.2,169.3 52.1,161.4 54.9,154.5 57.7,148.5 60.5,143.1 63.3,138.2 66.1,133.8 68.9,129.7 71.7,126.0 74.5,122.5 77.3,119.2 80.1,116.1 82.9,113.2 85.7,110.5 88.5,107.9 91.3,105.4 94.1,103.1 96.9,100.9 99.7,98.7 102.5,96.6 105.3,94.7 108.1,92.8 110.9,90.9 113.7,89.2 116.5,87.5 119.3,85.8 122.1,84.2 124.9,82.7 127.7,81.2 130.5,79.7 133.3,78.3 136.1,76.9 138.9,75.6 141.8,74.3 144.6,73.0 147.4,71.8 150.2,70.5 153.0,69.4 155.8,68.2 158.6,67.1 161.4,66.0 164.2,64.9 167.0,63.8 169.8,62.8 172.6,61.8 175.4,60.8 178.2,59.8 181.0,58.9 183.8,57.9 186.6,57.0 189.4,56.1 192.2,55.2 195.0,54.3 197.8,53.5 200.6,52.6 203.4,51.8 206.2,51.0 209.0,50.2 211.8,49.4 214.6,48.6 217.4,47.9 220.2,47.1 223.0,46.4 225.8,45.6 228.7,44.9 231.5,44.2 234.3,43.5 237.1,42.8 239.9,42.1 242.7,41.4 245.5,40.8 248.3,40.1 251.1,39.5 253.9,38.8 256.7,38.2 259.5,37.6 262.3,37.0 265.1,36.4 267.9,35.8 270.7,35.2 273.5,34.6' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,50.0 150.0,50.0 280.0,50.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='33.0' y1='180.0' x2='33.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='209.7' cy='50.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='213.7' y='42.0'>(e−1, 1)</text><circle cx='98.0' cy='50.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='64.0' y='44.0'>(0,1)</text><circle cx='98.0' cy='100.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='104.0' y='114.0'>(0,0)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 100.0H294.0M98.0 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='163.0' y1='97.0' x2='163.0' y2='103.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='160.0' y='114.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='228.0' y1='97.0' x2='228.0' y2='103.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='225.0' y='114.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='95.0' y1='150.0' x2='101.0' y2='150.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='154.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='95.0' y1='50.0' x2='101.0' y2='50.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='54.0' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Puntos de corte: \\((0,0)\\), \\((e-1,1)\\) y \\((0,1)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=e-1\\) la recta queda por encima. Uso \\(\\int\\ln(x+1)\\,dx=(x+1)\\ln(x+1)-x\\) (por partes):</p>\\[A=\\int_0^{e-1}\\bigl(1-\\ln(x+1)\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[x-(x+1)\\ln(x+1)+x\\Bigr]_0^{e-1}=2(e-1)-e\\cdot1=e-2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=e-2\\approx0{,}718\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "part",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
