  {
   "id": "matematicas-2011-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Determina el punto simétrico del punto \\(A(-3,1,6)\\) respecto de la recta \\(r\\) de ecuaciones \\(x-1=\\dfrac{y+3}2=\\dfrac{z+1}2\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\((1,-3,-1)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(1,2,2)\\): \\(r\\equiv(1+t,\\,-3+2t,\\,-1+2t)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(1,\\ 2,\\ 2)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x+2y+2z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(A(-3,\\ 1,\\ 6)\\): \\((-3)+2\\cdot1+2\\cdot6+D=0\\iff D=-11\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x+2y+2z-11=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[(1+t)+2(-3+2t)+2(-1+2t)-11=0\\iff 9t-18=0\\iff t=2\\]\\[M(3,\\ 1,\\ 3)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(A\\) y su simétrico \\(A'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{-3+a}2=3,\\qquad\\frac{1+b}2=1,\\qquad\\frac{6+c}2=3\\]\\[a=9,\\qquad b=1,\\qquad c=0\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-4,\"el\":15,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-4.193,0.851,6.745],[7.196,-4.843,6.745],[10.193,1.149,-0.745],[-1.196,6.843,-0.745]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[10.193,1.149,-0.745],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[3.1,1.2,3.2],[2.832,1.2,3.334],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.832,1.2,3.334],[2.732,1.0,3.134],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.253,-0.493,1.507],[3.747,2.493,4.493],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.747,2.493,4.493],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[3.2,1.4,3.4],[3.567,2.133,4.133],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[3.537,1.0,2.732],[3.903,1.733,3.465],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[-3.0,1.0,6.0],[9.0,1.0,0.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[-3.0,1.0,6.0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3.0,1.0,3.0],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[9.0,1.0,0.0],\"A′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m11ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m11ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m11ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m11ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='127.8,18.0 26.0,81.4 154.9,246.0 256.7,182.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='158.9' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='145.6' y1='128.4' x2='145.3' y2='124.3' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='145.3' y1='124.3' x2='141.0' y2='127.9' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='109.2' y1='158.6' x2='173.5' y2='105.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='179.5' y='105.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='149.9' y1='124.9' x2='165.7' y2='111.8' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m11ja4d)'/><text x='169.7' y='107.8' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='142.1' y1='140.3' x2='157.9' y2='127.2' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m11ja4n)'/><text x='163.9' y='137.2' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='132.6' y1='39.4' x2='150.1' y2='224.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='132.6' cy='39.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='139.6' y='33.4' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='141.3' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='149.3' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='150.1' cy='224.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='157.1' y='218.6' font-weight='700'>A′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='25.1' y2='274.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='22.5' y='279.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='269.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.5' y='273.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(A'(9,\\ 1,\\ 0)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{AM}=(6,\\ 0,\\ -3)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(6+2\\cdot0+2\\cdot(-3)=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
